  "title": "Create Multi-Brand Experiences with Ease Using Brand Names",
  "summary": "As companies grow, their brands often evolve alongside them. Many organizations operate multiple brands under a single parent company to serve different audiences, enter new markets, test new products, or create more specialized customer experiences. In lending and embedded finance, that flexibility is especially important because each customer journey needs to feel tailored, relevant, and aligned with the audience it serves.",
